 also used it to find plant people to contact for local information. For this Mexico trip I found a huge number of observations posted by Manuel ... \",\"title\":\"https://blog.pensoft.net/2023/03/30/tax-man-turned-taxonomist-a-citizen-scientists-journey-into-botany/\"}],\"query\":\"Queen Arwa University 2022 students trip plant samples\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"previously_received\":true,\"ref\":\"d1\",\"snippet\":\" ... Graduation ceremony held [Archives:2003/645/Community]\\n\\nQueen Arwa University's graduation ceremony of the fourth batch, also named the \\\"unity and democracy batch\\\", from colleges of engineering, science, arts, commerce, and rights was held on Sunday June 22 at the Queen Arwa University in Sanaa with the ... \",\"title\":\"https://yementimes.com/queen-arwa-university-celebrates-another-achievementgraduation-ceremony-held-archives2003-645-community/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"previously_received\":false,\"ref\":\"d33\",\"snippet\":\" ... After the internationally recognized government relocated the national bank from Sanaa to Aden in 2016, it stopped paying salaries to public-sector employees in Houthi-controlled areas. Many teachers quit teaching because of this, and they were replaced by inexperienced volunteers.\\n\\nSanaa University was established in 1970 to ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sanaa\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"previously_received\":false,\"ref\":\"d31\",\"snippet\":\" ... Queen Arwa University\\n\\nQueen Arwa University is a Yemeni private university founded in 1996 in Yemen and named after Queen Arwa.Queen Arwa UniversityQueen Arwa University | Ranking & Review The university's different fields of study include humanities and social sciences, commercial sciences and administration, engineering, science, higher education ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Queen_Arwa_University\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"previously_received\":false,\"ref\":\"d30\",\"snippet\":\" ... Sector Chairman, Abdulghani al-Shameri said that the Queen Arwa University has done its spare no efforts to hold such activities for the benefit of the Palestinians.\\n\\nWe are hoping that other universities will follow the example of the Queen Arwa University, in highlighting the Palestinian issue to ... \",\"title\":\"https://yementimes.com/arwa-university-holds-annual-cultural-activities-archives2002-20-local-news-3/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"previously_received\":false,\"ref\":\"d34\",\"snippet\":\" ... The ceremony itself is set to begin at 19hoo Moroccan time (18h00 GMT/19h00 Lagos time/20h00 Johannesburg, CAT time/21h00 East African time).\\n\\nPlayers and officials are expected to begin arriving at the event 90 minutes before the ceremony begins.\\n\\nCAF Awards live stream/How to watch ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.espn.com/espn/story/_/id/42926230/caf-awards-2024-date-how-watch-lookman-banda-co-morocco\"}],\"query\":\"Queen Arwa University Sanaa bank management tribute ceremony\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_3aa92228762a4694995dadbd"},{"content":"Excellent! I found strong matches for Criteria A and B. Let me read the 2002 article about the three-day event and verify the details.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"length\": 6000, \"ref\": \"d30\", \"start\": 0}","name":"read"},"id":"call_7a09f0ba20b34d1fbd559d34","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Queen Arwa University 2022 plant samples trip students\", \"Queen Arwa University website article 2022 botany field trip\", \"Queen Arwa University college science plant collection students 2022\"]}","name":"search"},"id":"call_f6e55ebab6de47d3a48a07bb","index":1,"type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"evidence\":{\"document\":\"d30\",\"document_chars\":2464,\"end\":2464,\"kind\":\"raw_evidence\",\"ref\":\"e2\",\"sha256\":\"22bc740c55a9a335edc92e76fb036399f1ad5b3486a41dc71d4322e1f2922523\",\"snapshot\":\"22bc740c55a9a335edc92e76fb036399f1ad5b3486a41dc71d4322e1f2922523\",\"start\":0,\"text\":\"---\\ntitle: Arwa University holds annual cultural activities [Archives:2002/20/Local News]\\ndate: 2002-05-13\\n---\\nArwa University holds annual cultural activities [Archives:2002/20/Local News]\\n\\nBY ABDUH AL-SABRI\\n\\nYEMEN TIMES STAFF\\n\\nUnder the sponsorship of the president Ali Abdullah Saleh and under the motto (Jerusalem is Ours), the Queen Arwa University held its Fifth Cultural Week (FCW) on May 9-11 2002, which was coincided with the Palestine Intifadha against the Zionist atrocities in the occupied land.\\n\\nThe 3-day FCWs activities focused mainly on the Palestinian support. Symposiums, political and cultural lectures were delivered to show solidarity with people in Palestine. Al-Afeef Cultural Foundation had a vital participation in making the FCW a success.\\n\\nDr. Abdulaziz Abdulghani, the Shura Council Chairman highly appreciated the efforts exerted by the Queen Arwa University and making of the FCW a success in packing the Palestinians up.\\n\\nOur brothers in Palestine have been fighting tooth and nails for the sake of their legal right which represents a true exemplary of a resounding victory of strong Palestinian will, the Shura Council Chairman highly praised Palestinians.\\n\\nIn the same context, the T.V. Sector Chairman, Abdulghani al-Shameri said that the Queen Arwa University has done its spare no efforts to hold such activities for the benefit of the Palestinians.\\n\\nWe are hoping that other universities will follow the example of the Queen Arwa University, in highlighting the Palestinian issue to the public, al-Shameri said to the Yemen Times reporter.\\n\\nOn the sideline of the FCWs activities, a bazaar was allotted to support the Palestinian Intifadha.\\n\\nPoetic sessions soiree was delivered by the Dr. Abdulaziz al-Makaleh and Sulaiman al-Aisi in conjunction with al-Afeef Cultural Foundation. In addition to this, several exhibitions shows were presented by the Arab and foreign embassies in our country.\\n\\nThe FCW was attended by the Shura Council Chairman, Abdulaziz Abdulghani, State Minister of the Human Rights, Dr. Waheeba Farae, the Palestinian Ambassador, Yahia Rabah, members of the diplomatic missions on Yemen, social dignitaries, members of the parliament, academicians, teaching staff of the university and others.\\n\\nDuring the FCWs activities, distinguished top participants were honored in appreciation of their limitless efforts to support Palestinians.\\n\\n——\\n\\n[archive-e:20-v:2002-y:2002-d:2002-05-13-p:./2002/iss20/ln.htm]\"},\"executed\":true,\"next_start\":null,\"ok\":true,\"previously_received\":false}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_7a09f0ba20b34d1fbd559d34"},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"previously_received\":true,\"ref\":\"d31\",\"snippet\":\" ... Ghassan Hashim\\nstudents: 5000\\nundergrad: 19, 000\\nadministrative_staff: 200\\nacademic_staff: 480\\ncity: Sana'a\\ncountry: Yemen\\naffiliation: Ministry of Higher Education and Scientific Research of Yemen\\nwebsite: Queen Arwa University\\n\\nQueen Arwa University is a Yemeni private university founded in 1996 in Yemen and named after ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Queen_Arwa_University\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"previously_received\":true,\"ref\":\"d1\",\"snippet\":\" ... Wahiba Fare'a, rector of the university delivered a speech in which she made clear that since it was established in 1995, Queen Arwa University has been active in adopting the best and most effective methods for building students physically, psychologically, and mentally.\\n\\nThe university's award of ... \",\"title\":\"https://yementimes.com/queen-arwa-university-celebrates-another-achievementgraduation-ceremony-held-arch